          "EUR 700,000 is payable on the ordinary claim and EUR 1,750,000 on the single security loss. The separate confidentiality losses of EUR 250,000 and EUR 100,000 are uncapped and take precedence over security for the overlapping loss, totaling EUR 2,800,000 payable."
